The data files in this `sample_data/` directory — `samp_data_1.xlsx` and its
paired variable list `samp_var_list.xlsx` — are a demonstration subset of the
data from the studies of Kara et al. (2026a, 2026b). They are released under the
**Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)** license
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

You are free to use, share, and adapt these files for any purpose, including
research and commercial use, provided you give appropriate credit as required
by CC BY 4.0.

## Required attribution

These files include modeled predictions from the associated study. If you use
them, cite **both** the paper the predictions derive from and the dataset
version of record:

> Kara, R. S., Ongun, A. R., Almaz, C., Çiçek, G., Tepecik, M., & Yilgan, F.
> (2026a). Diagnostic modeling of nutrients to support agroecosystem
> transitioning in tobacco soils: A stratified evaluation framework based on
> clay-organic matter-lime interactions [Manuscript submitted for publication].
> Department of Soil Science and Soil Protection, Czech University of Life
> Sciences Prague.
>
> Kara, R. S., Ongun, A. R., Almaz, C., Çiçek, G., & Tepecik, M. (2026b).
